{"v":2,"catch":"讓它們長得巨大，然後將它們炸得粉碎！","desc":"《POP'N BOUNCE》是VIDEO SYSTEM於1997年推出的打磚塊遊戲。\n當相鄰敵人角色（即磚塊）顏色相同，便會融合為單一單位。\n盡可能串連更多敵人使其成長，擊破後可獲得巨額分數與強化道具！\n\n“ACA NEOGEO”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請欣賞成就一代電子遊戲的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2026-03-12","genres":["動作"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e674ce77dc03a0f088818cc0eb59c2023c5e03dabfab1a6fd14bdda683e9e709.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9783e3303d3be828e2e2154d5b79bdd99a0cb35459d194fdc203723c32e53d50.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7b8b7df44936dfae8501f67266b73df083a001efcc0c3c932b1acc6b5d52803b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e30a05084b6a2167834db17923be5ddc33759bfc6ad50372d8e17146736beed5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ac104a8b4408c0a39bfba06b742cc9352c1ee3c6e112785cb5978404cd230e7e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/822d857f692cf0cdb4bc60bacbe5479e3fd2cb606b779e74d56208650a0e62ed.jpg"],"titleId":"010011f025850000"}